{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.92] I go so hard\n[00:08.36] Goddamn\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.38] I go so hard, I go so hard\n[00:13.76] I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (Stick)\n[00:17.18] We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk\n[00:20.12] Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick, brick)\n[00:23.24] I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[00:25.98] In that Bentley truck, yes I feel exotic\n[00:28.72] Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[00:31.72] I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it\n[Verse 1]\n[00:34.76] Rollie white as fuck, like I just put a brick on it (What else?)\n[00:37.52] Your Rollie fake as fuck, boy you can hear the tick on it\n[00:40.44] The way she suck me up, I thought it was a tick on me (Ooh)\n[00:43.48] I get the money, then I split it with my big homies (Ooh)\n[00:46.28] You show your man off, that nigga ain't got shit on me (Hoo)\n[00:49.22] My clothing like my state of mind, I got Revenge on me (Hoo)\n[00:52.50] F&N on me (Phew), that's a sick homie (Phew)\n[00:55.06] Not big enough, my shit will smoke you like a cig homie\n[00:58.02] I bought a couple Gucci coats, 'cause it's a cold world (Yeah)\n[01:01.00] I dropped the pill in the lean, watch it fizz on me\n[01:04.04] Ain't enough love for me in the whole world\n[01:06.94] My apologies, my heart be getting big on me\n[Chorus]\n[01:09.92] I go so hard, I go so hard\n[01:12.86] I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (Stick)\n[01:15.72] We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk\n[01:18.68] Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick, brick)\n[01:21.66] I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[01:24.52] In that Bentley truck, yes I feel exotic\n[01:27.26] Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[01:30.26] I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it\n[Verse 2]\n[01:33.24] Sip so much, everybody think that I'm gon' die on it\n[01:36.16] I put my heart into this shit like I just cried on it\n[01:38.96] My brother flippin' in his grave, there's niggas lyin' on him\n[01:42.58] His homies wasn't ever my homies\n[01:45.36] Niggas get to shootin' like they Prigioni\n[01:47.96] I get lean straight from Houston, that's the Whitney on me\n[01:50.64] You see that bag 'round my neck\n[01:52.16] That's the semi on me (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:53.62] If I got a backpack it's probably cause it's a titty on it\n[01:56.74] I spent ten racks all on shoes, hella kicks on me\n[01:59.56] It make me feel some type of way, like my name Rich Homie\n[02:02.54] New Balenciaga's on me, I bought two pairs\n[02:05.46] They ain't runners but you niggas know I'm still runnin'\n[02:08.22] Ya dig?\n[Chorus]\n[02:08.62] I go so hard (Haha), I go so hard (Haha)\n[02:11.40] I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (Stick)\n[02:14.26] We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk\n[02:17.22] Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick, brick)\n[02:20.32] I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[02:23.06] In that Bentley truck, yes I feel exotic\n[02:25.80] Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[02:28.80] I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it","words":[[1.68,1.78,"[Intro]"],[1.92,1.92,"I"],[5.58,5.62,"go"],[5.8,6.06,"so"],[6.92,7.34,"hard"],[8.36,8.92,"Goddamn"],[9.48,9.82,"[Chorus]"],[11.38,11.38,"I"],[11.42,11.48,"go"],[11.66,11.76,"so"],[11.98,12.28,"hard,"],[12.88,12.88,"I"],[12.92,12.98,"go"],[13.14,13.24,"so"],[13.48,13.7,"hard"],[13.76,13.8,"I'm"],[14.28,14.28,"a"],[14.6,15.06,"rockstar,"],[15.12,15.22,"my"],[15.32,15.58,"brother"],[15.66,15.74,"with"],[15.78,15.92,"that"],[15.98,16.28,"stick"],[16.4,16.62,"talk"],[16.74,17.14,"(Stick)"],[17.18,17.24,"We"],[17.32,17.44,"don't"],[17.52,17.68,"say"],[17.8,18.02,"shit"],[18.2,18.26,"at"],[18.34,18.42,"all,"],[18.46,18.48,"we"],[18.52,18.6,"don't"],[18.64,18.78,"like"],[18.88,18.94,"that"]